{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-12-2","kind":"proposition","title":"圆面积之比等于直径平方之比","englishTitle":"Circles are to one another as the squares on the diameters.","book":12,"number":2,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.2","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.2/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":2,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","contentId":"euclid-12-2","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f8637d0dc32206b06e0e8ad5332fe169c02677c40eab46b629e03a1e3c0e49e9","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-12-2.statement","euclid-12-2.construction.1","euclid-12-2.proof.1","euclid-12-2.proof.2","euclid-12-2.construction.2","euclid-12-2.construction.3","euclid-12-2.proof.3","euclid-12-2.proof.4","euclid-12-2.construction.4","euclid-12-2.proof.5","euclid-12-2.construction.5","euclid-12-2.proof.6","euclid-12-2.proof.7","euclid-12-2.proof.8","euclid-12-2.proof.9","euclid-12-2.proof.10","euclid-12-2.proof.11","euclid-12-2.proof.12","euclid-12-2.proof.13","euclid-12-2.proof.14","euclid-12-2.proof.15","euclid-12-2.proof.16","euclid-12-2.proof.17","euclid-12-2.proof.18","euclid-12-2.construction.6","euclid-12-2.proof.19","euclid-12-2.proof.20","euclid-12-2.proof.21","euclid-12-2.conclusion","euclid-12-2.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-12-2.statement","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2ac43cfe551bdfe65ffd286c37beb86fd4fef7d42f8682a2e6f0430e2ead23b1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Circles are to one another as the squares on the diameters."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"两个圆的面积之比，等于它们直径的平方之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2e551fb1865074cc13e9be57793660269e48ae7b1143adeb65de1d08db87c0ce","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let ABCD, EFGH be circles, and BD, FH their diameters; I say that, as the circle ABCD is to the circle EFGH, so is the square on BD to the square on FH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让ABCD,EFGH圈,BD,FH直径;我说,ABCD圆与EFGH圆的比等于BD和正方形的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8f6ae19d39fafbedd985acbf73ee70ce279ac15d38e83fe36e4e09c2b41e929","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if the square on BD is not to the square on FH as the circle ABCD is to the circle EFGH, then, as the square on BD is to the square on FH, so will the circle ABCD be either to some less area than the circle EFGH, or to a greater."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果BD的正方形不是FH的正方形,ABCD的EFGH圆,那么BD的正方形是FH的正方形,FH的正方形圆,ABCD的ABCD圆,要么是EFGH圆以外的区域,要么更大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c25a97c5fb5de2fa9ec8beab53a9e8cc7c511c442d61fc360967c7828732dd91","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"First, let it be in that ratio to a less area S."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"首先,让它在比中 少一个面积S。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":4,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"83927431bc362d5d325a061772755b91f8801d9e9ccf3c1ace2d2689e54d6884","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the square EFGH be inscribed in the circle EFGH; then the inscribed square is greater than the half of the circle EFGH, inasmuch as, if through the points E, F, G, H we draw tangents to the circle, the square EFGH is half the square circumscribed about the circle, and the circle is less than the circumscribed square; hence the inscribed square EFGH is greater than the half of the circle EFGH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让正方形 EFGH在EFGH圆上标,正方形在EFGH圆上标,大于EFGH圆的半数,因为如果通过E、F、G、H点我们切入圆,正方形EFGH是圆上限定的正方形的一半,圆上标的正方形比EFGH圆上标的少;因此,正方形EFGH标的比EFGH圆上的一半大。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.construction.3","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":5,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"02994c52d671d5b9b5ab056d337ca0751783a6ff7280922e0db2c5443ed4f29f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the circumferences EF, FG, GH, HE be bisected at the points K, L, M, N, and let EK, KF, FL, LG, GM, MH, HN, NE be joined; therefore each of the triangles EKF, FLG, GMH, HNE is also greater than the half of the segment of the circle about it, inasmuch as, if through the points K, L, M, N we draw tangents to the circle and complete the parallelograms on the straight lines EF, FG, GH, HE, each of the triangles EKF, FLG, GMH, HNE will be half of the parallelogram about it, while the segment about it is less than the parallelogram; hence each of the triangles EKF, FLG, GMH, HNE is greater than the half of the segment of the circle about it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将EF、FG、GH、HE环绕线在K、L、M、N点分为两部分,EK、KF、FL、LG、GM、MH、HN、NE环绕线连接;因此,EKF、FLG、GMH、HNE三角的每一个三角都大于其圆形半边,因为如果通过K、L、M、N点,我们向圆形切线划线,完成EF、FG、GH、HE直线上的平行四边形个三角形,每个三角形的EKF、FLG、GMH、HNE三角形,将是其圆形上平行四边形个三角形的一半,而圆形的分线则小于平行四边形个;因此,EKF、FLG、GMH、HNE三角形的每个三角形都大于圆形上半个三角形。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed0545b7ab44016bca2443036f7c5bc29bf6379546286ff570dce965959b6f9f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Thus, by bisecting the remaining circumferences and joining straight lines, and by doing this continually, we shall leave some segments of the circle which will be less than the excess by which the circle EFGH exceeds the area S."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,通过将余下的环绕线分成两部分,并连成直线,我们将会不断这样做,留下圆中一些小于EFGH圆超过S区域的部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"22852a07fb483f6717a924ea475d3c9024bde406db04be627660fb8e9be3adad","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For it was proved in the first theorem of the tenth book that, if two unequal magnitudes be set out, and if from the greater there be subtracted a magnitude greater than the half, and from that which is left a greater than the half, and if this be done continually, there will be left some magnitude which will be less than the lesser magnitude set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"第十本书的第一个理论证明,如果列出两个不平等的数值,如果从较大的数量中减去一个大于一半的数值,从剩下的数量中减去一个大于一半的数值,如果连续进行,则留下一个低于所列较小数量的数量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.construction.4","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":8,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ae4adfe7c6c4fc0997e8dac60b79e27d4c6c005986c971a023971e23a60014bf","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let segments be left such as described, and let the segments of the circle EFGH on EK, KF, FL, LG, GM, MH, HN, NE be less than the excess by which the circle EFGH exceeds the area S."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将上述各段留作不同部分,使EFGH圈的EK、KF、FL、LG、GM、MH、HN、NE段小于EFGH圈超过S区域的超出部分。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"467b2ae7c7ea260da48516b318e166348308ca0c4ef5f5f63ab52025c85a1460","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the remainder, the polygon EKFLGMHN, is greater than the area S."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,其余的多边形 EKFLGMHN大于S区域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.construction.5","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":10,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9e60a33db1822221369ac105d285ad6055723dc8b7c1709ee06dd926f5868fd9","citations":["euclid-12-1"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let there be inscribed, also, in the circle ABCD the polygon AOBPCQDR similar to the polygon EKFLGMHN; therefore, as the square on BD is to the square on FH, so is the polygon AOBPCQDR to the polygon EKFLGMHN. [[XII. 1](/principles/euclid-12-1)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"也请在ABCD圆圈内标注类似于多边形 EKFLGMHN的多边形 AOBPCQDR;因此,BD对FH对正方形的比等于多边形 AOBPCDR对多边形 EKFLGMHN的比。 [[XII. 1](/principles/euclid-12-1)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"23e0b152097dcd620f5cc7c8a6d71df0549a6276f76761073858f371aa3596b4","citations":["euclid-5-11","euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the square on BD is to the square on FH, so also is the circle ABCD to the area S; therefore also, as the circle ABCD is to the area S, so is the polygon AOBPCQDR to the polygon EKFLGMHN; [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] therefore, alternately, as the circle ABCD is to the polygon inscribed in it, so is the area S to the polygon EKFLGMHN. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,由于BD的正方形与FH与FH与S区域之间的距离,因此ABCD与S区域之间的距离也等于多边形AOBPCQDR与多边形EKFLGMHN之间的距离;因此,该ABCD与多边形中标定的多边形圆与S区域与多边形EKFLGMHN之间的距离。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5d07824c6ca3fdfc418f593eee2bce7f1d0122a7975058d8ec6c65a1e929173c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the circle ABCD is greater than the polygon inscribed in it; therefore the area S is also greater than the polygon EKFLGMHN."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但ABCD圆大于其中的多边形圆,因此,S区域也大于多边形 EKFLGMHN。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a7e45d6b69d5ea21ce07c423c2a7249b0b963ea402798736d9d191c715abfd5b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is also less: which is impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但情况也更少:这是不可能做到的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3a108a39e6e3a204e9fe4f5a445172878c74f73da7440b13cf1b7f9a2c2aea03","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the square on BD is to the square on FH, so is not the circle ABCD to any area less than the circle EFGH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BD比正方形的比等于FH比正方形的比,即不比ABCD比低于EFGH的面积的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c7e1ad3a0c4475643a5e63c68350c193785983bd0bb4a4650ea715c510bd5eac","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Similarly we can prove that neither is the circle EFGH to any area less than the circle ABCD as the square on FH is to the square on BD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"同样,我们可以证明,EFGH圈对任何区域而言都不如ABCD圈,因为FH的正方形圈对BD的正方形圈。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6e5b19d0610224da047e5d3e12762b0c6e53bc6e45714804ff9ba35158703a36","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say next that neither is the circle ABCD to any area greater than the circle EFGH as the square on BD is to the square on FH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我接下来要说的是,ABCD圆的面积都大于EFGH圆,BD正方形圆的面积也大于FH圆的面积。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8913fc5414048d4faf99fdca2d560cfd8bd2345d56ee544f6aa6dca5d03ed3e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let it be in that ratio to a greater area S."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,让它与更大的面积S的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4561d869a40d0ac887c10fcf70ff50a6be3703bc024f8cac7c92191ae2b8c18f","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, inversely, as the square on FH is to the square on DB, so is the area S to the circle ABCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,FH对DB对正方形的比相当于S对ABCD圆的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d3cb9fc93ff88f223abcbaade9fd907ce16607668293776413e805ed89c3becb","citations":["euclid-5-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as the area S is to the circle ABCD, so is the circle EFGH to some area less than the circle ABCD; therefore also, as the square on FH is to the square on BD, so is the circle EFGH to some area less than the circle ABCD: [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)] which was proved impossible."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,S区域与ABCD圆之比等于EFGH圆与低于ABCD圆的某一区域之比;因此,FH区域与BD区域之比为正方形,等于EFGH区域与ABCD圈之比,而ABCD圈与ABCD区域之比为EFGH;事实证明,这是不可能的。 [[V. 11](/principles/euclid-5-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1b73ff11660361cf3f51d4782da2033ad0e199ae73b367ff0a54422241924cc7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as the square on BD is to the square on FH, so is not the circle ABCD to any area greater than the circle EFGH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,BD比正方形的比等于FH比正方形的比,即不大于EFGH的ABCD比任何区域的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5091605c1730985858ac7d57d70e983cea49610dcf3defef777e36ee2a27f56a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it was proved that neither is it in that ratio to any area less than the circle EFGH; therefore, as the square on BD is to the square on FH, so is the circle ABCD to the circle EFGH."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"事实证明,与EFGH圆以下的任何区域的比,两者都不相同;因此,BD和FH之间正方形和正方形的比等于ABCD和EFGH圆之间的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d41f4fe56dd428c759377c807a93013dffbbe29c7596acfdac57dd182cad51b6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,等等,证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e677e5c4e2cb43389ca34ccdf0214dd50673d355727273b753e94372a7a24f37","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Lemma. I say that, the area S being greater than the circle EFGH, as the area S is to the circle ABCD, so is the circle EFGH to some area less than the circle ABCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"莱姆马,我说,S区域大于EFGH圆,S区域与ABCD圈的比等于EFGH圈与低于ABCD圈的某个区域的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.construction.6","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":24,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"eddc9ec1b8149bc756dd13956e34d5877773dcb56ebfc4b9ebd62e00e697f9e1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let it be contrived that, as the area S is to the circle ABCD, so is the circle EFGH to the area T."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"不妨假设,S区域与ABCD圈的比等于EFGH区域与T区域的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f10066a6390f9614dac41c3c5be1de6b78d8f3dfc140be38f6145ae69f255ba0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the area T is less than the circle ABCD."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说,T区比ABCD圈小。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"353a3a8546501b90a77b4da9aee1fefe6bda2c69dae2888de907e4e6352ca3bf","citations":["euclid-5-16"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as the area S is to the circle ABCD, so is the circle EFGH to the area T, therefore, alternately, as the area S is to the circle EFGH, so is the circle ABCD to the area T. [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,S区域与ABCD圆的比等于EFGH区域与T区域的比,因此,S区域与EFGH区域的比等于ABCD区域与T区域的比。 [[V. 16](/principles/euclid-5-16)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e8a972aed6a3240633bde61a1ea2a8753d31a315dbd8e93803d3a64c190c2187","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the area S is greater than the circle EFGH; therefore the circle ABCD is also greater than the area T."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但S区域大于EFGH圆,因此ABCD区域也大于T区域。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":28,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"aaf8882b337a064e3048ff475b11c5e38c00e14bcadc481f0a9e8e1a22f5c6f7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Hence, as the area S is to the circle ABCD, so is the circle EFGH to some area less than the circle ABCD. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,S区域与ABCD圆的比等于EFGH区域与低于ABCD、Q、E、D圆的某一区域的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-12-2.source","contentId":"euclid-12-2","revisionId":"euclid-12-2@raw-f8637d0dc32206b0","order":29,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"04c99532301a197e765207d3ebc4a93903e1b4e5817575d46cd1f442bc17a752","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.2/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.2\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-12-2:euclid-12-1:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-2.construction.5"],"targetContentId":"euclid-12-1","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.2","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:12.prop.2/","sourceLabel":"XII. 1"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-12-2:euclid-5-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-12-2","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-12-2.proof.6","euclid-12-2.proof.14"],"targetContentId":"euclid-5-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis"